[I] An mpc-like control interface for mpv

[T] Music player in POSIX-sh interfacing mpv from the shell + extras/goodies. A
[T] fork of lwillets/mpvc evolving on its own adding features like: improved
[T] CLI, TUI, FZF, WEB, EQ, & play Invidious, YouTube & streaming services.

